§ `33, 35, 37. consent, examination of offenders, citizens abroad`

`33 instituted by the Public Prosecutor` MEANS `Procedure Facts` WITH
    `the prosecution is instituted by the Public Prosecutor` IS TRUE
    `the prosecution is instituted with the consent of the Public Prosecutor` IS FALSE
    `two or more persons are charged with an offence under this Act or under sections 161 to 165 or 213 to 215 of the Penal Code 1871, or with a conspiracy, attempt or abetment of one` IS FALSE
    `the person was required by the court under section 35(1) to give evidence as a witness for the prosecution` IS FALSE
    `the person required to give evidence in the opinion of the court makes true and full discovery of all things as to which he or she is lawfully examined` IS FALSE
    `the accused is a citizen of Singapore` IS FALSE
    `the offence under this Act was committed in a place outside Singapore` IS FALSE

`33 instituted with consent` MEANS `Procedure Facts` WITH
    `the prosecution is instituted by the Public Prosecutor` IS FALSE
    `the prosecution is instituted with the consent of the Public Prosecutor` IS TRUE
    `two or more persons are charged with an offence under this Act or under sections 161 to 165 or 213 to 215 of the Penal Code 1871, or with a conspiracy, attempt or abetment of one` IS FALSE
    `the person was required by the court under section 35(1) to give evidence as a witness for the prosecution` IS FALSE
    `the person required to give evidence in the opinion of the court makes true and full discovery of all things as to which he or she is lawfully examined` IS FALSE
    `the accused is a citizen of Singapore` IS FALSE
    `the offence under this Act was committed in a place outside Singapore` IS FALSE

`33 instituted by a private person` MEANS `Procedure Facts` WITH
    `the prosecution is instituted by the Public Prosecutor` IS FALSE
    `the prosecution is instituted with the consent of the Public Prosecutor` IS FALSE
    `two or more persons are charged with an offence under this Act or under sections 161 to 165 or 213 to 215 of the Penal Code 1871, or with a conspiracy, attempt or abetment of one` IS FALSE
    `the person was required by the court under section 35(1) to give evidence as a witness for the prosecution` IS FALSE
    `the person required to give evidence in the opinion of the court makes true and full discovery of all things as to which he or she is lawfully examined` IS FALSE
    `the accused is a citizen of Singapore` IS FALSE
    `the offence under this Act was committed in a place outside Singapore` IS FALSE

